OL,3,GNEWSAChain ferry ticket price rise
OL,4,Athrown out by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have voted against
OL,7,Fproposals to increase fares on the Isle
OL,8,Fof Wight's chain ferry and introduce a
OL,9,Fnew charge for under-19s.
OL,11,FThe idea had been to raise passenger
OL,12,Fand vehicle ticket prices to align the
OL,13,FFloating Bridge with Devon's Dartmouth
OL,14,FLower Ferry, as well as introducing a
OL,15,Fflat rate of #1 per crossing for
OL,16,Funder-19s between 19:00 and 07:00.
OL,18,FThe Dartmouth Lower Ferry currently
OL,19,Fcharges #2.50 for an adult single, #5
OL,20,Ffor an adult day return, #7.50 for a
OL,21,Fcar or small van single, and #14 for a
OL,22,Fcar or small van day return.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
