OL,3,GNEWSAChain ferry ticket price rise
OL,4,Athrown out by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe changes were recommended in a
OL,7,Freport by the authority's strategic
OL,8,Fdirector of community services but
OL,9,Frejected during a council committee
OL,10,Fmeeting on Tuesday night.
